From d196bfd50211cd8bbef3699cf18350ea1b038228 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 15:34:14 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD selected-agent slash commands to run through provider
 backends

Route slash-prefixed messages from selected agent chats into the provider command path so commands such as /status and /fork use backend-native behavior instead of ordinary prompt sends. Document the provider-neutral command execution hook because it extends the public backend contract.
---
 docs/architecture.md  |   4 +
 src/agent_runtime.rs  |  22 ++++-
 src/cli.rs            |  63 +++++++++++++
 src/codex.rs          | 149 ++++++++++++++++++-----------
 src/workspace.rs      | 215 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++------
 tests/terminal_app.rs |   9 ++
 tests/workspace.rs    |   9 ++
 7 files changed, 386 insertions(+), 85 deletions(-)

